WEBVTT

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.880
Gru to see Mr Perkins.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.320
Yes, please have a seat.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.720
That's one small step for man,

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:58.160
one giant leap for mankind.

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:00.880
Ma, someday I'm going
to go to the moon.

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.760
I'm afraid you're too late, Son.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.440
NASA isn't sending
the monkeys any more.

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:15.840
Hey.

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:26.960
I'm applying for a new villain
loan. Go by the name of Vector.

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:32.840
It's a mathematical term,

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:37.240
a quantity represented by an arrow,
with both direction and magnitude.

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.000
Vector! That's me,

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:48.120
'cause I'm committing crimes
with both direction and magnitude.

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:49.800
Oh, yeah!

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:53.400
Check out my new weapon.

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:55.640
Piranha gun! Oh, yes!

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:57.720
Fires live piranhas.
Ever seen one before?

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:01.480
No, you haven't. I invented it.
Do you want a demonstration?

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:03.400
Shoot!

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:06.520
So difficult, sometimes to get
the piranha back inside of my...

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:08.880
Mr Gru, Mr Perkins
will see you now.

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:11.040
So, all I need

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:14.040
is money from the bank
to build a rocket.

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:16.960
- And then, the moon is ours.
- Wow!

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:19.600
Well, very nice presentation.

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:21.880
I'd like to see this shrink ray.

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:25.880
Absolutely! Will do.
Soon as I have it.

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:28.800
You don't have it?

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:32.400
And yet you have the audacity
to ask the bank for money?

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:34.880
Apparently.

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:39.120
Do you have any idea of the capital
that this bank has invested in you?

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:44.560
With far too few of your sinister
plots actually turning a profit.

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:49.040
How can I put it? Let's say this
apple is you.

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:51.960
If we don't start getting
our money back...

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:55.360
Get the picture?

00:02:56.720 --> 00:03:00.160
Look, Gru, the point is, there are
a lot of new villains out there,

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:03.160
younger than you,
hungrier than you,

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:05.200
younger than you.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:07.480
Like that young fellow out there
named Vector.

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:09.080
He just stole a pyramid!

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:15.440
I've got it. I've got it.

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:19.280
So, as far as getting money
for the rocket...

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:22.240
Get the shrink ray,
then we'll talk.

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:49.560
Suckers!

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:55.680
Suckers!

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:03.560
We got it!

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:11.400
What?

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:14.160
Hey! Hey! What! Hey!

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:16.800
No, no, no!

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:21.320
You!

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:27.800
Now, maybe you'll think twice
before you freeze someone's head!

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:29.600
So long, Gru!

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:33.440
Quick! We can't let him get away!

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:42.560
Up ahead! Up ahead!

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:45.280
Fire! Fire, now!

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:54.560
You missed me!

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:56.600
Come to papa!

